### Local secrets ###
deploy/.env
# Any .env or .env.<suffix> anywhere, with the committed template re-included.
**/.env
.env.*
!deploy/.env.example
# Drive OAuth client secret: storage-service's default GOOGLE_CREDENTIALS_PATH
# is ./secrets/client_secret.json, relative to wherever the service is run.
secrets/
client_secret*.json
# JWT key pairs: the README's openssl commands write jwt-private.pem and
# jwt-public.pem to the current directory.
*.pem

### Local data ###
# PDF_DIRECTORY for the Compose stack (./pdfs, relative to deploy/), and V1's
# PDF folder when copied in for ingestion.
deploy/pdfs/
deploy/ISM_PDF/

### Unrelated personal files kept at the repository root ###
Claude outputs/
